WEBVTT

00:34.828 --> 00:35.920
Wake up.

00:46.506 --> 00:47.973
Alexiel...

00:49.075 --> 00:50.508
We finally found it.

00:51.111 --> 00:53.238
You who turn the ocean
the color of zinc,

00:53.346 --> 00:56.645
the forest into yellow desert,
the wind into gun smoke,

00:56.749 --> 00:58.649
and scorch the sky.

00:59.419 --> 01:01.387
Adam's first wife, Lilith,
was the free-spirited woman...

01:01.488 --> 01:03.183
...who became the bride of a demon.

01:03.289 --> 01:06.520
You are about to repeat
her evil deeds.

01:06.659 --> 01:09.958
Lucifer was once the most
brilliant being in the sky.

01:10.630 --> 01:12.359
He was a vision of beauty.

01:13.166 --> 01:15.896
You are about to repeat
his rebellion.

01:21.407 --> 01:24.934
Listen to the lamentation of
the winged species in the sky.

01:26.112 --> 01:30.276
They were sent by the Creator to
announce the day of judgement.

01:30.717 --> 01:33.185
They are neither gods
nor human.

01:34.354 --> 01:36.117
Lord forgive me.

01:36.456 --> 01:40.085
Now that I have broken the seal
with the forbidden black magic,

01:41.261 --> 01:44.719
all I can do is
adhere to him.

01:48.768 --> 01:49.894
They are called...

01:51.471 --> 01:52.631
...angels.

01:57.110 --> 01:59.908
Whoa. That moon is huge.

02:57.704 --> 02:58.932
Big brother!

03:01.708 --> 03:03.073
Now's the chance!

03:13.319 --> 03:15.344
Had enough, Setsuna Mudo?

03:15.555 --> 03:18.149
No more Mr. Smart-ass?

03:18.258 --> 03:21.193
Don't get carried away,
goddamn freshman!

03:21.527 --> 03:22.994
Kira.

03:23.129 --> 03:25.597
That's enough, Yoji.

03:25.698 --> 03:29.156
Screw you. I'm trying to teach
him about manners.

03:29.269 --> 03:31.396
If you butt in, I'll...

03:32.872 --> 03:35.272
Did you hear what I just said?

03:35.375 --> 03:36.342
I did.

03:38.111 --> 03:39.601
The damn punks.

03:39.712 --> 03:42.772
They don't care for the light
hair or the look of yours.

03:42.915 --> 03:44.678
This puts me in a terrible bind.

03:45.118 --> 03:47.712
I'm caught between my personal
sidekick and my gang buddies.

03:48.688 --> 03:50.019
Hey, Setsuna?

03:50.790 --> 03:51.757
Say something.

03:53.293 --> 03:54.487
I wanna do the nasty.

03:54.727 --> 03:55.386
Huh?

03:56.562 --> 03:59.554
God, do you think I'm a beast?

04:01.034 --> 04:02.023
You idiot!

04:03.136 --> 04:05.900
I've told you so many times
not to fight!

04:06.739 --> 04:07.671
Sara.

04:14.414 --> 04:15.312
Unbelievable!

04:15.415 --> 04:18.179
Are you telling me you enjoy
being a punching bag more...

04:18.284 --> 04:20.445
...than a date with
your beloved little sister?

04:20.553 --> 04:21.611
You're a shitty brother.

04:22.388 --> 04:24.117
Don't make me out to
be a masochist.

04:24.424 --> 04:26.824
Look, the trains are finally
running again.

04:26.926 --> 04:28.917
That was a pretty long blackout.

04:29.195 --> 04:31.857
Kira, I hope you're not planning
to stray my brother...

04:31.964 --> 04:34.626
...into a troubled path
like you did in middle school.

04:34.767 --> 04:35.597
In fact...

04:35.735 --> 04:38.203
What's that?
You wanna see my room?

04:38.304 --> 04:39.498
Sure, let's go.

04:39.639 --> 04:40.833
What the...

04:40.973 --> 04:42.463
Are you listening to me?

04:42.575 --> 04:44.065
You listen, too, big brother.

04:44.277 --> 04:45.539
Have you forgotten?

04:45.645 --> 04:48.546
Even though the folks' divorce
got us living apart,

04:48.648 --> 04:50.479
we promised to meet
once a month.

04:50.583 --> 04:52.141
Today is the day.

04:52.285 --> 04:55.186
I picked a fight so I don't have
to bother with that crap.

04:55.421 --> 04:56.547
What did you say?

04:56.789 --> 04:58.051
- Damn you! Damn you!
- Ouch. Aw.

04:58.191 --> 05:01.285
I'm too old for this.
Knock yourselves out.

05:02.061 --> 05:03.153
Kira.

05:08.167 --> 05:10.829
Look, I want to know why.

05:11.804 --> 05:14.568
Why did you try to
stand me up today?

05:14.841 --> 05:19.642
Well, for siblings our age to be
running around together seems...

05:19.979 --> 05:20.911
...strange, no?

05:23.583 --> 05:27.713
Why do you think
the folks split up?

05:29.422 --> 05:31.617
I suppose it had to do with
Dad having an affair.

05:31.724 --> 05:36.184
Still, I don't understand why
Mom is so sweet to me and yet...

05:36.295 --> 05:37.694
...She hates me?

05:39.098 --> 05:40.725
She says I give her the creeps.

05:42.869 --> 05:44.666
Because I'm not normal.

05:46.172 --> 05:47.036
Big brother...

05:48.107 --> 05:49.005
Sara.

05:58.184 --> 05:59.082
Who the...?

06:00.153 --> 06:02.485
Are you all right?
Do you have any pain, Sara?

06:03.055 --> 06:05.216
I'm fine.
What in the world was that?

06:05.491 --> 06:06.822
Thank goodness. Ouch.

06:07.527 --> 06:09.154
Setsuna? Are you hurt?

06:09.295 --> 06:12.355
I'm all right. It hurts where
I got kicked in the fight.

06:12.732 --> 06:15.826
Dummy, don't worry about me
when you're hurt yourself.

06:15.968 --> 06:18.436
I'd rather be hurt than
see you hurt.

06:20.006 --> 06:21.701
It's not what you think, silly.

06:21.808 --> 06:24.072
If anything should happen to
you, Mom would give me hell.

06:24.710 --> 06:27.907
God, I'm sure this is old news
to you by now...

06:28.314 --> 06:31.181
There's only one person
I want...

06:31.317 --> 06:33.512
That's so typical of
your devilish charm.

06:33.886 --> 06:36.081
You're always saying
the meanest things, and then,

06:36.189 --> 06:39.681
out of the blue, you can blurt
out such an endearing remark.

06:39.792 --> 06:42.022
Well, I think you're right.

06:42.762 --> 06:45.128
It is strange for siblings
to go on dates.

06:45.231 --> 06:47.495
I think I've got a severe case
of "brother complex."

06:49.001 --> 06:51.697
Sara and I are really saying
the same thing.

06:51.838 --> 06:53.567
But I'm gonna get over it.

06:53.673 --> 06:56.233
I have to grow out of my idiot
brother some time, right?

06:57.009 --> 06:59.204
Say, are you really all right?

06:59.345 --> 07:00.312
Yeah.

07:00.513 --> 07:03.448
Well, you can take off here.
Thanks for walking me home.

07:04.250 --> 07:05.683
There's a difference, though.

07:05.785 --> 07:09.687
You don't love me the same way
I love you.

07:11.524 --> 07:15.893
Oh, God, if you do exist,
grant me a wish.

07:16.395 --> 07:18.590
Please protect
that unspoiled angel...

07:18.698 --> 07:21.394
...from my animalistic intentions.

07:23.970 --> 07:27.406
Look, Kurai.
I doubt he's the one.

07:27.974 --> 07:30.340
He's certainly giving off
a good amount of astral light,

07:30.443 --> 07:32.343
but I only sense a human aura
about him.

07:32.512 --> 07:34.912
There's no question. I can tell.

07:35.248 --> 07:39.150
Setsuna Mudo...
I'm coming for you.

07:40.753 --> 07:43.688
I told you.
Setsuna is tough as hell.

07:43.990 --> 07:46.288
You should heed
your friend's warnings.

07:46.859 --> 07:49.692
Screw you, Kira. If you hadn't
butted in then, I would've...

07:49.829 --> 07:51.456
It'll be an easy win next time.

07:51.831 --> 07:54.857
Didn't you see how he went weak
in the knees after a while?

07:55.334 --> 07:56.824
That's because she showed up.

07:57.970 --> 08:01.371
She acts as a restraint for him.

08:01.974 --> 08:03.805
Prevents him from
killing people.

08:05.978 --> 08:07.138
Never mind.

08:07.246 --> 08:10.613
I said you should get your usual
drug fix and cool your head.

08:10.716 --> 08:12.081
Kira, you bastard!

08:12.218 --> 08:14.482
You'd better back off
from the kid, or...

08:15.121 --> 08:19.080
I could get seriously mad,
know what I mean, Yoji, Kato?

08:24.864 --> 08:26.354
What a hopeless dreamer I am.

08:27.333 --> 08:31.133
How could I even think Sara and
I are not biologically related?

08:31.771 --> 08:32.669
In the end,

08:32.772 --> 08:36.299
this family registration made
it excruciatingly clear to me...

08:36.409 --> 08:38.809
...that we are blood siblings
beyond doubt.

08:51.691 --> 08:54.319
Do you believe in God?

08:55.728 --> 08:58.026
There he was, loved by all,

08:58.130 --> 09:00.496
loved even by the Creator
of the cosmos himself.

09:00.600 --> 09:04.263
Not she, however.
She rejected him.

09:05.438 --> 09:08.874
Denial, conflict, ambivalence
toward awakening...

09:09.041 --> 09:12.306
They're symptoms of unconscious
escapism borne out of guilt.

09:12.545 --> 09:15.639
Your soul shudders
at its own self-blame.

09:16.682 --> 09:19.242
Hello, my dear sister Alexiel.

09:25.391 --> 09:28.155
Setsuna...

09:28.628 --> 09:29.617
Setsuna.

09:29.895 --> 09:31.920
Kira, I just saw this weird
foreigner...

09:32.064 --> 09:33.463
Weird foreigner?

09:35.301 --> 09:36.290
Setsuna?

09:38.237 --> 09:41.297
Well? How are you coping with
your problem down there?

09:42.975 --> 09:45.842
Listen, I can send over any of
my lady friends anytime.

09:47.013 --> 09:48.674
Setsuna, you know what?

09:50.182 --> 09:52.548
You should quit seeing Sara.

09:53.686 --> 09:55.449
I saw you two yesterday.

09:55.588 --> 09:58.022
Your face betrays your feelings
all too easily.

09:58.157 --> 10:00.250
It's not what you think.

10:02.328 --> 10:03.818
What are you talking about?

10:04.030 --> 10:07.488
You've always tended toward
messy romances for some reason.

10:08.267 --> 10:09.495
Here, take this.

10:09.935 --> 10:11.334
It's an amulet.

10:12.571 --> 10:14.471
I'll kill you if you lose it.

10:15.641 --> 10:16.699
Later.

10:26.719 --> 10:27.913
Another one?

10:28.154 --> 10:29.712
Oh, brother!

10:30.189 --> 10:32.054
Can't you do something
besides dodge?

10:32.158 --> 10:33.125
I've seen you two before.

10:33.359 --> 10:36.726
So you noticed?
I'm impressed, big boy.

10:36.862 --> 10:39.387
I'm the fourteenth child of King
Gehenna of the nether world.

10:39.498 --> 10:41.056
The name is Kurai
the Dragon Master.

10:41.167 --> 10:42.794
This here is my cousin Arachne.

10:43.269 --> 10:45.396
In short, we're demons
from hell.

10:46.706 --> 10:48.367
Anyway, your reaction was
pretty bizarre.

10:48.474 --> 10:52.069
Alexiel would have crushed it
with one finger.

10:52.378 --> 10:53.743
Alexiel...

10:58.084 --> 11:00.143
You're babbling nonsense.

11:00.252 --> 11:02.652
Anyway, nice showy prank.
Good luck explaining yourselves.

11:02.922 --> 11:05.857
I'm going home.
You go back to the hospital.

11:06.192 --> 11:09.252
Hold it. You'll get hurt
if you underestimate us.

11:09.361 --> 11:12.125
We're the demons who crawl up
from hell to devour human flesh.

11:12.231 --> 11:15.564
The noble blood of the Evils
runs in our veins.

11:15.668 --> 11:17.829
I never knew there were
homosexual demons.

11:18.237 --> 11:19.636
What gave you that idea?

11:19.739 --> 11:22.037
I'm quite perceptive
when it comes to these matters.

11:22.141 --> 11:24.109
Besides... your tits are crooked.

11:24.210 --> 11:27.304
You must be using some cheap
padding, Miss Thing.

11:28.714 --> 11:30.944
That's none of your business!

11:38.691 --> 11:42.058
Stop fooling around
and wake up!

11:51.170 --> 11:52.467
Why won't he fight back?

11:52.605 --> 11:54.971
- What's going on?
- What was that noise?

11:55.207 --> 11:56.435
Kurai. People are gathering.

11:57.143 --> 12:00.738
You caught a break today.
I'll be back, Setsuna Mudo.

12:14.093 --> 12:15.355
Once again...

12:15.494 --> 12:18.224
He doesn't get a scratch
even in major accidents.

12:18.330 --> 12:19.627
It's creepy.

12:20.065 --> 12:22.090
Shit! Who the hell were they?

12:22.434 --> 12:24.834
- What a mess!
- Are you all right, kid?

12:24.937 --> 12:26.131
Alexiel...

12:28.274 --> 12:30.742
It won't be long.
Not long at all.

12:31.443 --> 12:34.105
Rebelling against God, Alexiel
led the Evil demons and invaded...

12:34.213 --> 12:35.737
...the sacred realm of Azuilt...

12:35.848 --> 12:38.681
...in what became known as
the Cosmic War.

12:39.084 --> 12:43.020
During the decisive battle,
Alexiel exhausted all her power,

12:43.122 --> 12:45.420
and was divided into body
and spirit,

12:45.524 --> 12:47.788
then sealed inside
an angel crystal.

12:49.128 --> 12:53.087
She was an angel who had sinned
by collaborating with us demons.

12:53.332 --> 12:54.390
All this time...

12:55.000 --> 12:58.800
We've been looking for you for
what seemed like an eternity.

13:01.273 --> 13:02.706
It's been so long.

13:05.010 --> 13:08.639
It was a long, long siesta,
Cherub Katan.

13:09.882 --> 13:11.042
Sir Rosiel...

13:13.385 --> 13:16.752
The celestial sphere is in
a chaotic turmoil.

13:17.122 --> 13:21.081
Since God took his last sleep,
satanic forces have been active.

13:21.760 --> 13:25.093
Without God, Berrier, the Garden
of Angels, is being ravaged by...

13:25.197 --> 13:27.495
...constant power struggles among
the angels in the upper ranks...

13:27.600 --> 13:29.397
...and their elitist dictatorship.

13:29.735 --> 13:33.432
Their duty is to keep peace on
earth, not engage in bloody war.

13:33.539 --> 13:34.938
This is an unspeakable outrage!

13:35.441 --> 13:38.706
That is why my comrades and I
have dared break the taboo.

13:38.811 --> 13:40.745
By converting the electrical
energy of this city...

13:40.846 --> 13:43.838
...into celestial power, we were
able to lift the seal on you.

13:49.021 --> 13:51.956
Alongside your counterpart,
Organic Angel Alexiel,

13:52.057 --> 13:54.958
you once reigned at the top
of the celestial hierarchy.

13:55.261 --> 13:57.855
Inorganic Angel Rosiel,
you alone can salvage heaven.

13:58.297 --> 14:01.095
Please return to Azuilt.

14:02.668 --> 14:04.067
Not just yet.

14:05.037 --> 14:08.006
Now that I found what I've been
looking for...

14:08.707 --> 14:13.144
I can't go back yet. Not until
I resurrect Alexiel's spirit.

14:14.179 --> 14:15.544
It was a tough find.

14:15.848 --> 14:18.874
So let's resurrect
the spirit already.

14:18.984 --> 14:20.815
There's a way to do this, right?

14:21.120 --> 14:22.451
Hell, how should I know?

14:22.621 --> 14:25.146
You mean, we have to keep
pressuring that guy...

14:25.257 --> 14:27.157
...'til the spirit decides
to wake up?

14:28.093 --> 14:29.390
That could take forever.

14:29.628 --> 14:34.497
She means a lot to me.
Alexiel does.

14:41.073 --> 14:43.064
Stop it. Don't touch me.

14:44.376 --> 14:45.400
Stop it.

14:45.711 --> 14:47.110
No!

14:50.716 --> 14:54.174
How pitiful.
Is this what angels have become?

14:54.687 --> 14:57.713
Their spirituality is weakened
by lust and violence.

14:57.823 --> 15:01.657
The wicked have more integrity
in their lack of pretense.

15:02.561 --> 15:04.153
Can you stand up,
little demon?

15:04.830 --> 15:07.230
Use your frustration
and toughen up.

15:07.333 --> 15:09.528
The weak will only end up dead.

15:09.635 --> 15:11.762
I am Organic Angel Alexiel.

15:11.870 --> 15:14.703
I hereby declare a revolt
against God!

15:20.646 --> 15:22.546
Again with Alexiel...

15:23.449 --> 15:26.111
Shit! That damn brat's
invading my dream!

15:30.522 --> 15:32.820
SETSUNA MUDO - COME TO
THE ABANDONED FACTORY

15:34.493 --> 15:35.255
Sara.

15:36.662 --> 15:37.959
It's my fault.

15:38.564 --> 15:40.828
Sara's in trouble
because of me.

15:41.266 --> 15:44.030
I don't want to cause her
any pain.

15:49.041 --> 15:50.872
What's the big rush?

15:51.010 --> 15:52.602
Did your old memory come back yet?

15:52.811 --> 15:55.211
I have no time to waste on you.

15:55.414 --> 15:57.279
Don't ever let me see
your mugs again.

15:59.351 --> 16:00.841
What's eating him?

16:00.986 --> 16:02.385
This could be our chance.

16:04.857 --> 16:06.381
A new drug, huh?

16:07.226 --> 16:09.353
In a capsule form, no less.
Very unusual.

16:09.461 --> 16:10.393
Try it.

16:10.929 --> 16:13.193
I've never seen you
selling here before.

16:13.332 --> 16:16.358
Your buddy Yoji bought
the stuff from me, too.

16:17.536 --> 16:18.560
Oh, well.

16:18.971 --> 16:19.903
Have a nice dream.

16:29.281 --> 16:30.248
Big brother.

16:30.482 --> 16:32.450
Hey, thanks for coming.

16:32.551 --> 16:33.575
I knew you punks are behind it.

16:33.685 --> 16:37.746
I commend you, Setsuna,
on your stupidity!

16:48.567 --> 16:49.795
Big brother.

16:55.307 --> 16:56.205
Big brother.

16:58.544 --> 17:00.774
Shit. I feel my power draining.

17:02.881 --> 17:07.045
I guess they found out
that his weakness is Sara.

17:23.735 --> 17:24.963
Let her go.

17:25.204 --> 17:26.762
I'm not bluffing.

17:26.872 --> 17:29.568
I warn you, I'm in a hell
of a bad mood today.

17:30.042 --> 17:32.272
And I mean now.

17:33.278 --> 17:36.406
You think you've turned
the table, Alexiel?

17:48.827 --> 17:51.421
That's a golem.
What is it doing here?

17:51.797 --> 17:53.264
Hold on, Kurai.

17:53.465 --> 17:57.265
This is a golden opportunity for
awakening. Let's wait and see.

18:00.772 --> 18:03.104
What is this thing?
Let me go, damn it.

18:04.510 --> 18:06.478
What are you staring at?

18:11.016 --> 18:11.914
Let me go.

18:13.619 --> 18:15.382
Aw. Stop it.

18:15.721 --> 18:16.813
Let me go!

18:19.958 --> 18:21.186
Setsuna.

18:26.665 --> 18:29.600
Why? Why doesn't he unleash
the power?

18:29.701 --> 18:31.896
He'll die if he doesn't
do something.

18:32.037 --> 18:33.231
Kurai, look.

18:43.749 --> 18:45.273
But he's...!

18:46.652 --> 18:47.914
I can't move.

18:48.020 --> 18:50.887
This mysterious and icy energy
in the air...

18:51.256 --> 18:52.416
It's extraordinary.

18:59.598 --> 19:00.895
You look awful.

19:01.833 --> 19:03.061
Who are you?

19:03.268 --> 19:07.864
I am Rosiel. I once was the most
luminous angel in heaven.

19:08.540 --> 19:12.670
Blessed by the grace of God,
I stood at the apex of glory...

19:13.579 --> 19:16.207
...until I was sealed
on this earth by spell.

19:17.783 --> 19:20.115
You can't tell me
you've forgotten.

19:20.219 --> 19:24.178
That's an act of unconscious
escapism borne out of guilt.

19:24.323 --> 19:28.851
Remember, Alexiel, you tried to
kill me, your own twin brother.

19:29.628 --> 19:31.459
Why do you refuse to wake up?

19:31.563 --> 19:34.054
What binds you to your present
form of existence...

19:34.166 --> 19:36.794
...that is worth that much misery?

19:36.969 --> 19:39.233
Run...

19:40.572 --> 19:41.470
Sara.

19:43.909 --> 19:45.035
I see.

19:45.877 --> 19:49.904
Your love for her is what
compels you to stay as Setsuna.

19:50.249 --> 19:53.582
Then, all I have to do
is kill this girl.

19:55.654 --> 19:59.181
I'll peel you like an apple and
make you unfit to be looked at.

19:59.391 --> 20:01.256
Don't do it, Rosiel.

20:11.737 --> 20:12.761
What is this?

20:12.904 --> 20:14.895
This power is of neither
darkness nor light.

20:15.707 --> 20:17.834
Holy Hermit Adam-Kadamon?

20:18.343 --> 20:20.573
My power is being wiped out.

20:20.946 --> 20:23.938
Is this the legendary
cosmic magic?

20:26.018 --> 20:28.578
Go away. You're an afterimage.

20:28.787 --> 20:30.846
Why do you show up
after all this time?

20:35.761 --> 20:36.750
Sir Rosiel.

20:37.262 --> 20:38.524
Over here.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.855
Stay out of my way, Katan.

20:47.272 --> 20:48.364
So warm...

20:49.241 --> 20:52.267
This feels all so familiar
somehow.

20:53.812 --> 20:56.781
Where are you going?
I've been wanting to see you.

20:57.849 --> 20:59.214
Don't go.

21:00.986 --> 21:02.419
My arm...

21:04.323 --> 21:05.221
Tears?

21:08.427 --> 21:09.325
Sara.

21:12.497 --> 21:13.464
Thank goodness.

21:13.899 --> 21:15.389
You understand now?

21:15.567 --> 21:16.556
You!

21:16.702 --> 21:19.068
I've never seen that type
of light before either.

21:19.171 --> 21:23.369
But now you can clearly see that
you're no ordinary human being.

21:23.809 --> 21:27.677
You are the reincarnation
of Angel Alexiel after all.

21:28.747 --> 21:30.806
Enough already.
I'm sick of you all.

21:32.084 --> 21:34.552
I don't give a damn about angels
and reincarnations.

21:35.754 --> 21:38.416
I've got more important things
to do right now.

21:38.590 --> 21:40.649
Why don't you go back to
your own country?

21:40.759 --> 21:43.751
Who knows, more important things
could be waiting for you there.

21:43.995 --> 21:46.020
My country no longer exists.

21:46.598 --> 21:50.432
It was destroyed by you humans
and angels.

21:51.303 --> 21:53.794
The Kingdom of Gehenna
and your domain, Usher,

21:53.905 --> 21:55.338
are two sides of the same coin.

21:55.440 --> 21:58.739
As the human race polluted the
sky and impoverished the land,

21:58.844 --> 22:00.812
Gehenna, in turn, also
deteriorated.

22:00.912 --> 22:04.746
That is when, in an attempt to
end the long-term conflict...

22:04.850 --> 22:07.410
...with the Evils, angels violated
the cease-fire pact,

22:07.519 --> 22:09.919
invaded our nation and
wiped out all my people...

22:10.021 --> 22:12.819
...including the females,
the young and the invalids.

22:15.060 --> 22:17.654
Alexiel, you took me in.

22:17.763 --> 22:20.129
You promised revenge.

22:20.232 --> 22:23.326
You talked about creating
an ideal world without God...

22:23.435 --> 22:25.528
You don't give a damn, you say?

22:25.637 --> 22:28.105
If you were going to
abandon me this way,

22:28.206 --> 22:32.939
why didn't you leave me to die
in the sea of blood?

22:33.111 --> 22:37.741
You showed me a ray of hope
and now you're...

22:37.849 --> 22:39.009
This is terrible.

22:39.618 --> 22:42.314
How could you do this to me,
Alexiel?

22:43.488 --> 22:46.889
You're talking to an ordinary
high school student.

22:47.826 --> 22:51.353
And a hopeless moron at that
who can't even protect a woman.

22:52.264 --> 22:54.289
You speak of "ideals" and "hope"

22:54.399 --> 22:56.993
but this puny brain of mine
can't comprehend those ideas.

22:57.135 --> 23:01.071
I'm sorry, but there's nothing
I can do for you now.

23:04.075 --> 23:05.099
Kurai.

23:05.410 --> 23:10.177
What do you expect? I can't
think of anybody else but her.

23:11.483 --> 23:15.476
I knew full well
that I'm not normal.

23:17.456 --> 23:20.687
But you've accepted me
for who I am like nothing.

23:20.892 --> 23:24.089
Sara, you were the last person
I wanted to hurt.

23:25.363 --> 23:26.830
So I hoped.

23:30.602 --> 23:33.503
I don't want to hurt you.

23:37.976 --> 23:38.874
Mother.

23:41.146 --> 23:43.137
You stupid bastard!

23:43.248 --> 23:47.742
I knew about your feelings for
her, but it's not to be.

23:47.886 --> 23:50.081
You're her biological brother.

23:50.355 --> 23:53.324
I've hardened my heart
against you for what?

23:53.692 --> 23:57.219
I separated you two
for your own good.

23:57.362 --> 23:58.989
Enough, you old hag.

23:59.097 --> 24:00.689
Do you want to send her to hell?

24:00.866 --> 24:01.924
I know all that.

24:02.100 --> 24:05.069
Can't you see what your doing
will only make her unhappy?

24:05.203 --> 24:06.101
I know.

24:07.105 --> 24:08.572
Stop it!

24:09.307 --> 24:10.296
Sara.

24:10.442 --> 24:11.909
Please stop. It's alright.

24:12.244 --> 24:13.802
She heard it...

24:14.880 --> 24:17.678
...my secret that no one
must know.

24:17.816 --> 24:19.647
You see, I love him, too.

24:19.784 --> 24:23.618
For a long, long time,
I've always loved him the most.

24:27.058 --> 24:28.116
Wrong.

24:28.660 --> 24:30.992
No, Sara. Yours is not love.

24:31.129 --> 24:34.621
You don't love me the same way
I love you.

24:34.766 --> 24:36.734
You'll find a nice man.
Setsuna is only...

24:36.835 --> 24:37.699
Wrong.

24:37.802 --> 24:39.235
...making sport of you.

24:39.504 --> 24:41.131
Please, that's enough, Mom.

24:41.273 --> 24:42.171
Wrong.

24:43.408 --> 24:44.739
She's exactly right.

24:46.811 --> 24:49.974
That's it. I should say
the opposite of what I think.

24:50.248 --> 24:52.682
I was pent up, y'know.

24:53.351 --> 24:54.875
So I figured, "let me make do
with my sister."

24:55.120 --> 24:56.587
Be perfectly arrogant...

24:56.688 --> 24:57.655
But I got caught.

24:58.490 --> 25:00.390
I mean, why else would I bother...

25:00.492 --> 25:03.017
...with an underdeveloped kid
like you?

25:03.562 --> 25:04.824
Destroy.

25:04.963 --> 25:05.895
It's a lie.

25:06.631 --> 25:09.964
Just because I gave you a measly
peck while you were asleep,

25:10.068 --> 25:11.558
you think I love you?

25:11.703 --> 25:13.330
See? It's so easy.

25:13.471 --> 25:14.836
Don't be presumptuous.

25:14.940 --> 25:15.907
Mercilessly shattered.

25:16.007 --> 25:17.872
Man, I hate stupid chicks.

25:19.744 --> 25:20.870
Broken into pieces.

25:23.181 --> 25:25.342
Sara.

25:25.450 --> 25:27.315
I won't see Sara again.

25:28.153 --> 25:30.280
That would be best for her.

25:31.056 --> 25:35.083
Search as she may
to the end of the world,

25:35.994 --> 25:37.655
wait as she may for centuries,

25:38.129 --> 25:40.393
she'll never meet another man
who'll love her more than I do.

25:40.632 --> 25:42.657
He doesn't exist!

25:47.872 --> 25:50.670
Why did you get in my way?

25:50.809 --> 25:55.644
But sir, the girl called Sara
has nothing to do with Alexiel.

25:55.814 --> 25:56.940
So what?

25:57.349 --> 26:00.546
You're not to interfere
with my business, Katan.

26:00.652 --> 26:03.382
I'm determined to be the one
to awaken Alexiel.

26:05.323 --> 26:08.224
I'm sorry. Did I hurt you?

26:08.893 --> 26:10.554
I'm truly sorry.

26:10.662 --> 26:12.789
I'm really grateful for
your delivering me,

26:12.897 --> 26:15.730
for your willingness to even
commit a crime in doing so.

26:15.834 --> 26:19.793
But look, I've been betrayed by
my own twin sister, and had to...

26:19.904 --> 26:22.395
...spend centuries, confined in
the bitter cold of the soil.

26:22.607 --> 26:24.905
Try to understand my humiliation
...please?

26:25.043 --> 26:25.941
Yes, sir.

26:26.244 --> 26:29.145
Tell me, Katan, am I beautiful?

26:29.314 --> 26:33.774
As beautiful as I was
when I reigned over Azuilt?

26:34.252 --> 26:37.744
Yes, you haven't changed at all
since those days.

26:40.325 --> 26:42.623
That's right.
Everyone tells me so.

26:42.827 --> 26:44.692
My dear sister,
you're the only exception.

26:44.796 --> 26:48.254
If you still refuse to love me
when you awake,

26:48.366 --> 26:50.630
then I'll have to kill you
with my own hands.

26:52.103 --> 26:56.164
Sir Rosiel is our last hope for
the salvation of heaven.

26:56.274 --> 26:58.606
But his heart is fixated
on Alexiel,

26:58.710 --> 27:00.940
and he will not return to Azuilt.

27:01.046 --> 27:03.241
What am I to do?

27:28.907 --> 27:33.776
Tracing your wound with my lips,

27:34.713 --> 27:38.911
I'm plunged by a piece of
a broken dream.

27:40.819 --> 27:45.119
The knife of romance
concealed deep within

27:46.624 --> 27:50.185
is pressed against
my half-formed skin.

27:53.031 --> 27:58.298
The night is without
consolation.

27:58.837 --> 28:04.241
I want you to rip it apart
with your kiss.

28:04.743 --> 28:09.976
You are the last romanticist left.

28:10.381 --> 28:11.575
Slice it up.

28:11.783 --> 28:17.244
To the bottom of my heart...
darling.

28:17.822 --> 28:21.588
I want my heart broken
each time I fall in love

28:21.993 --> 28:27.761
To discover
the afterimage of angels.

28:28.500 --> 28:33.597
You are a romanticist
lost in the streets.

28:34.139 --> 28:41.045
Burn it all down
with your frigid heart, darling.

28:41.446 --> 28:45.610
I want to feel with each kiss
you can give me,

28:46.017 --> 28:51.250
Feel the tears of angels
falling like rain.

28:53.792 --> 28:56.454
What remains of the Evil race,
the deranged angel, Rosiel,

28:56.761 --> 28:58.456
not to mention an Adam-Kadamon.

28:58.563 --> 29:01.794
Setsuna's attracted a hell of
a crew, that troublemaker.

29:02.700 --> 29:04.258
Wake up, Setsuna.

29:04.669 --> 29:08.833
The people, the whole world,
is waiting for your awakening.

29:09.240 --> 29:12.232
Humans, angels, or demons...

29:12.343 --> 29:16.040
Who gets exterminated
is up to you.
